WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.520
There's a button in the middle of town

00:00:01.720 --> 00:00:05.640
and nobody's allowed to press it. The

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:07.240
whole town is built around it in perfect

00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:08.760
circles, every house [music] facing the

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:10.960
center where the button sits under a

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:12.880
glass case with two guards who never

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:15.240
take their eyes off it. Around all of it

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:17.440
is a wall so tall nobody's ever seen

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:19.600
over it. At night, a glow comes from the

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:21.880
other side and every year it gets a

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:23.960
little dimmer. But Gary's always noticed

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:27.000
two weird things. Under the glass, there

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:28.600
are 47 tiny scratches nobody can explain

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.480
and the statue of the town's founders

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:32.200
has a woman who looks exactly like his

00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:33.800
mom. So when his friends bet him five

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:35.720
bucks he won't press it, he can't say

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:37.600
no. At 3:00 in the morning, the guard

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:39.640
swap shifts and he's got about 30

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:41.360
seconds. He lifts the glass, holds his

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:43.640
breath and presses it, but nothing

00:00:41.360 --> 00:00:45.480
happens. Just a tiny scratching sound

00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:47.360
under the glass. But as he walks home,

00:00:45.480 --> 00:00:49.360
the glow over the wall is brighter than

00:00:47.360 --> 00:00:51.000
it's ever been. The next morning, Gary

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:52.960
wakes up in the grass. The houses are

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:54.760
gone, the guards are gone, and the whole

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:56.360
town is standing in an empty field

00:00:54.760 --> 00:00:58.120
around the button staring at it like

00:00:56.360 --> 00:01:00.720
they've never seen it before. Around the

00:00:58.120 --> 00:01:02.440
button, there are 48 scratches. Then his

00:01:00.720 --> 00:01:04.280
mom steps out of the crowd and says,

00:01:02.440 --> 00:01:07.360
"Nobody touches this. We'll build our

00:01:04.280 --> 00:01:07.360
town right here."

